<!doctype lake><title>🦫 𝓡𝓮𝓯𝓲𝓷𝓮𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="VZMmK" id="VZMmK" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub75bd572" id="ub75bd572"> </span><span data-lake-id="u9c15b790" id="u9c15b790">🦦</span><span data-lake-id="ucbd361ea" id="ucbd361ea"> 𝐆𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐩 𝐒𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u3f506b90" id="u3f506b90"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub924abc9" id="ub924abc9">强化学习已成为推动语言模型规模化发展的关键范式。通过大规模强化学习，语言模型能够开展更深入、更长的推理过程，从而获得解决竞赛级数学与编程等复杂问题的能力</span></strong></p><ul list="u2c1fd63c"><li fid="u7b39fc52" data-lake-id="u493c184c" id="u493c184c"><span data-lake-id="u66565495" id="u66565495">要通过增加计算投入成功扩展强化学习，首要前提是维持稳定且稳健的训练动态。以 GRPO 为代表的当前先进强化学习算法，在训练超大规模语言模型时存在严重的稳定性问题，往往导致灾难性且不可逆的模型崩溃。这种不稳定性阻碍通过持续强化学习训练进一步拓展语言模型能力边界的进程</span></li><li fid="u7b39fc52" data-lake-id="u30037c84" id="u30037c84"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d0b9b2d" id="u2d0b9b2d" style="color: #5C0036">GRPO 的不稳定性源于其算法设计中对重要性采样权重的根本性误用及其失效。这会引入高方差的训练噪声；随着回答长度增加，这些噪声逐渐累积，并被裁剪机制进一步放大，最终导致模型崩溃</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u612b968d" id="u612b968d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3ebf7b50" id="u3ebf7b50">为解决这些核心局限，提出组序列策略优化，一种用于训练大语言模型的新型强化学习算法。GSPO 的关键创新在于，基于序列似然，以具有理论依据的方式定义重要性比率，使其符合重要性采样的基本原理</span></strong></p><ul list="ubfcbec80"><li fid="ue290a2a7" data-lake-id="u78a907f1" id="u78a907f1"><span data-lake-id="ud00e127c" id="ud00e127c">GSPO 将同一查询下多个回答的归一化奖励作为优势，确保序列级奖励与优化之间的一致性</span></li><li fid="ue290a2a7" data-lake-id="u3d2b3974" id="u3d2b3974"><span data-lake-id="ud6674134" id="ud6674134">GSPO 从机制上解决大型混合专家模型强化学习训练中的稳定性问题，无需复杂的稳定化策略，并展现出简化强化学习基础设施的潜力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue9b71e26" id="ue9b71e26"><span data-lake-id="u6462fe4f" id="u6462fe4f">随着模型规模、稀疏性以及回答长度的增加，强化学习训练需要采用较大的采样批次规模，以最大化硬件利用率。为提高样本效率，通常会将一个大批次的采样数据划分为多个小批次，用于梯度更新。这一过程不可避免地引入离策略学习设定：回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22acW4j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04a54806" id="u04a54806">采样自旧策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F619756aa1fc9995330d2f111c852dc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PICiz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc2919fc2" id="uc2919fc2">，而非正在优化的当前策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jjNKZ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u38df6a72"><li fid="ued4755a0" data-lake-id="uc8b486e9" id="uc8b486e9"><span data-lake-id="u07eb9b4e" id="u07eb9b4e">解释 PPO 和 GRPO 中裁剪机制的必要性：该机制用于防止偏离当前策略过大的样本参与梯度估计</span></li><li fid="ued4755a0" data-lake-id="u9bd96a2f" id="u9bd96a2f"><span data-lake-id="uaae7d4c6" id="uaae7d4c6">GRPO 存在一个更为根本的问题：其优化目标是不适定的。在面向长回答任务训练大型模型时，这一问题尤为突出，并会导致灾难性的模型崩溃</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc2d9bf11" id="uc2d9bf11"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95d933c5" id="u95d933c5">GRPO 优化目标的不适定性源于对重要性采样权重的误用。重要性采样的基本原理是对从行为分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf0d9e65cadc0ab3a490d3f106ca0dad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ei4Ru%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u16da097c" id="u16da097c">中抽取的样本进行重新加权，以估计函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f4jQu%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f7fac5c" id="u2f7fac5c">在目标分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F304e3a4448ce23df8084879413b82e9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vx2OZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u185ef8cd" id="u185ef8cd">下的期望</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2702f9ca" id="u2702f9ca" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bz%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D%7D%5Bf(z)%5D%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bz%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D(z)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D(z)%7Df(z)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1e3629cc84e540603bea11e60c4a117.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22knkKH%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2fe5f4c7"><li fid="u05ab9da8" data-lake-id="uc8999f4a" id="uc8999f4a"><span data-lake-id="uf52375a6" id="uf52375a6">这一过程依赖于对来自行为分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf0d9e65cadc0ab3a490d3f106ca0dad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cSLlh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6104fb9e" id="u6104fb9e">的多个样本取平均，才能使重要性权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D(z)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D(z)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9429164ea654944424b2839216490aec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PtYrX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3379dc14" id="u3379dc14">有效校正分布失配</span></li><li fid="u05ab9da8" data-lake-id="u9cdd064c" id="u9cdd064c"><span data-lake-id="u3e82eefd" id="u3e82eefd">相比之下，GRPO 在每个 token 位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hmhXS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbfa172b" id="ucbfa172b">应用重要性权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcf06a58e1017036f6985dc78b8c9657.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YBIoL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u017b640a" id="u017b640a">。由于这一权重仅基于从每个下一 token 分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83a84dc865e76e64479156965fa2e89d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WYord%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub167e9ee" id="ub167e9ee">中抽取的单个样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf8c59fdae4f3076244da86294bc3ea3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22erB8z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b244044" id="u8b244044">，因此无法发挥预期的分布校正作用</span></li><li fid="u05ab9da8" data-lake-id="u3dad2c45" id="u3dad2c45"><span data-lake-id="u7f6f4b84" id="u7f6f4b84">相反，它会向训练梯度中引入高方差噪声。这些噪声沿长序列不断累积，并被裁剪机制进一步放大</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uda68fcb6" id="uda68fcb6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5de6426b" id="u5de6426b" style="color: #AE146E">Token 级重要性权重的失效指向一项核心原则：优化目标的粒度应与奖励的粒度保持一致。由于奖励赋予的是整个序列，在 token 级别进行离策略校正便存在问题。这促使放弃 token 级优化目标，转而探索直接在</span></strong><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e2c3f67" id="u3e2c3f67" style="color: #AE146E">序列级别</span></strong></em><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a535083" id="u1a535083" style="color: #AE146E">应用重要性权重并执行优化</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="cq94d" id="cq94d" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua7063ffc" id="ua7063ffc">🐌</span><span data-lake-id="u91fb0b5d" id="u91fb0b5d"> 𝐆𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐩 𝐒𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uc051975d" id="uc051975d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub854042d" id="ub854042d">尽管 GRPO 中的 token 级重要性权重</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcf06a58e1017036f6985dc78b8c9657.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qj7sZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud0b75e0b" id="ud0b75e0b">存在问题，但在语言生成场景中，序列级重要性权重</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e7fab9c8134d76bdcfd1382346d7b61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KJul6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uceb6de92" id="uceb6de92">具有明确的理论含义</span></strong></p><ul list="uecf9b80f"><li fid="uc726185f" data-lake-id="ud44abb4d" id="ud44abb4d"><span data-lake-id="u9f1cf39b" id="u9f1cf39b">它反映从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb36413f19ff52c1f979594f3a99482d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ezbRx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf80a70a8" id="uf80a70a8">中采样得到的回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ecV7u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u540b9697" id="u540b9697">相对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F267d9a76ec2a2db5b166c7408bebff2d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ganIi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf940d896" id="uf940d896">的偏离程度。这与序列级奖励自然保持一致，也能够为裁剪机制提供有意义的判据</span></li><li fid="uc726185f" data-lake-id="ud972954a" id="ud972954a"><span data-lake-id="u43ef3f63" id="u43ef3f63">基于这一观察，提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uafff3973" id="uafff3973">组序列策略优化（Group Sequence Policy Optimization，GSPO）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7d531296" id="u7d531296">算法。GSPO 采用以下序列级优化目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5a9ce817" id="u5a9ce817" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd57c1fdee09eb4c084a1990a98fe8f49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h5nqN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3c1e6da7" id="u3c1e6da7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Br(x%2Cy_i)-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5C%7Br(x%2Cy_i)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5C%7Br(x%2Cy_i)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F012229eeabfd9537d29fba02b669ccbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22djEvg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2b4cff68"><li fid="u646ef56d" data-lake-id="ua752bfe3" id="ua752bfe3"><span data-lake-id="u505a77f5" id="u505a77f5">并基于序列似然定义重要性比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fyoxD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubfd69acb" id="ubfd69acb">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc4aba6c2" id="uc4aba6c2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cexp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04bbfcfdc46c66abc21bc94bc65647eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jeyia%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua535efd4"><li fid="u45ae8c05" data-lake-id="uafb4a6a0" id="uafb4a6a0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9609e3dc" id="u9609e3dc" style="color: #663000">因此，GSPO 对整个回答进行裁剪，而非对单个 token 进行裁剪，以将偏离当前策略过大的样本排除在梯度估计之外。这同时与序列级奖励和序列级优化保持一致。需要说明的是，在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j7aAT%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u13026dbc" id="u13026dbc" style="color: #663000">中采用长度归一化，以降低方差，并将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OyCuP%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u309b3519" id="u309b3519" style="color: #663000">控制在统一的数值范围内</span></strong></li><li fid="u45ae8c05" data-lake-id="u0620c4e1" id="u0620c4e1"><span data-lake-id="u0e901c9c" id="u0e901c9c">否则，少数 token 的似然变化就可能导致序列级重要性比率剧烈波动，而不同长度回答的重要性比率也将需要不同的裁剪范围。此外，由于重要性比率的定义不同，GSPO 与先前算法的裁剪范围通常存在数量级上的差异</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u44ec38a5" id="u44ec38a5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5c786e1" id="uc5c786e1" style="color: #DF2A3F">梯度分析：可以按如下方式推导 GSPO 目标的梯度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="udf7f9d87" id="udf7f9d87" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Ds_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(8)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Ds_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(9)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(10)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19e3df8d7690843ee9be88d4eefef7d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BCTxr%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2d299e8d"><li fid="u233393a1" data-lake-id="ub7bebf2d" id="ub7bebf2d"><span data-lake-id="u4e1a4f66" id="u4e1a4f66">作为对比，GRPO 目标的梯度如下，注意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30bc2b7bdd5748e14cecf910c7c1ca78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lFeLq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81efee6a" id="u81efee6a">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc154ed14" id="uc154ed14" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Dw_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(11)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(12)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8015e74860f1f671e835affae6409f65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zGFFT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u84f67046" id="u84f67046"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc6c8d4ca" id="uc6c8d4ca">GSPO 与 GRPO 的根本区别在于如何对各 token 的对数似然梯度进行加权</span></strong></p><ul list="u93371fe2"><li fid="ua0653025" data-lake-id="ubc3f0681" id="ubc3f0681"><span data-lake-id="uac3f078a" id="uac3f078a">GRPO 中，各 token 按照各自的重要性权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcf06a58e1017036f6985dc78b8c9657.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lMIYl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ff7d411" id="u9ff7d411">进行加权。然而，这些不相等的权重可以在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(0%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5502bebd3a1a92826b05dcb325558479.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XiyI3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e02112a" id="u8e02112a">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%2B%5C%5Cinfty)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41dac3682179219a6d651e6d60475489.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mPVxr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7897b26d" id="u7897b26d">内变化，其影响不可忽略，并可能随着训练推进不断累积，产生难以预测的后果</span></li><li fid="ua0653025" data-lake-id="uedc62631" id="uedc62631"><span data-lake-id="u8bb47b83" id="u8bb47b83">相比之下，GSPO 对同一回答中的所有 token 赋予相同权重，从而消除 GRPO 中的这一不稳定因素</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5558e383" id="u5558e383"><strong><span data-lake-id="u52fe1a0b" id="u52fe1a0b">在多轮强化学习等场景中，可能希望以比序列级更细的粒度调整优势。引入 GSPO 的 token 级目标函数变体 GSPO-token，以支持按 token 分别设置优势</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue891db60" id="ue891db60" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO-token%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.3em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7B(13)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdfb1197be2c1d148742cfbc3e1962ff4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CccAQ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue5b2d4a5" id="ue5b2d4a5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5Bs_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef987ac00c9de4e1cbad453c42d30beb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hKF4q%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u58a2c732"><li fid="u115e4ce8" data-lake-id="u3ace3536" id="u3ace3536"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F565766aa7dad12254e0180dc38e60cc3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aT54b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub66d946b" id="ub66d946b">表示仅保留数值、同时停止梯度传播，对应于 PyTorch 中的 </span><code data-lake-id="u6843fac7" id="u6843fac7"><span data-lake-id="u3e8a0101" id="u3e8a0101">detach</span></code><span data-lake-id="uf9e79f6f" id="uf9e79f6f"> 操作。GSPO-token 的梯度可推导为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5cd7e835" id="u5cd7e835" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO-token%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Ds_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(15)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Ds_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(16)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%26%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.3em%5D%5Cn%26%26%5C%5Ctext%7B(17)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda94282fbfb1f1a0fcab857f5ad7967d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K8Qem%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucbda8b4e"><li fid="u3ef3ae60" data-lake-id="u94a409e7" id="u94a409e7"><span data-lake-id="u2f74dc99" id="u2f74dc99">注意，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bbdc5378263d4d6a446888be82f23fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dwNvH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b304a5f" id="u8b304a5f">在数值上等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IE2Ab%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u19dd2710" id="u19dd2710">，因此</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c516d3f10f2db6a859204b968476f0d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qDwIm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f5dae66" id="u4f5dae66">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X6QEr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ace0232" id="u5ace0232">在数值上相等。GSPO-token 与 GSPO 在优化目标、裁剪条件和理论梯度上均具有数值一致性，而 GSPO-token 在逐 token 调整优势方面具有更高的灵活性</span></li></ul>